{% extends 'archive.html.twig' %}
{% block body %}
<section class="hero">
    <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The Kid Pan Alley archive</p>
        <h1>Songs, stories,<br>and the words<br><em>behind them.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">Explore a working collection of Kid Pan Alley songs and lyrics, created with children, songwriters, schools, and communities. This archive brings scattered song lists and lyric documents together in one searchable place.</p>
        <a class="button" href="{{ path('song_search') }}">Search the archive <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="songbook" aria-hidden="true"><div class="songbook-label">KID PAN ALLEY<br>SONGS &amp; LYRICS</div><div class="staff">♪<span>♫</span>♪</div><div class="songbook-title">A world of stories,<br>one song at a time.</div><div class="songbook-bottom">WORDS · MUSIC · IMAGINATION <span>↗</span></div></div>
</section>
<section class="archive-stats" aria-label="Archive at a glance"><div><strong>{{ stats.songs|number_format }}</strong><span>catalog records currently loaded</span></div><div><strong>{{ stats.lyrics|number_format }}</strong><span>records with lyrics</span></div><p>A work in progress.<br>Not a verified song total.</p></section>
<section class="about-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Inside the archive</p><h2>Bringing the collection<br>together.</h2></div><div><p>The archive is being assembled from the master song spreadsheet and original lyric documents. You can search titles, lyrics, schools, and other catalog details, then open an individual record to read more.</p><p>The work is ongoing: some lyrics are missing, records may overlap, and we have not yet confirmed that the whole archive has been scanned and matched. The counts above describe what is loaded today—not how many distinct songs exist.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ path('song_search') }}">Start your search <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section>
<section class="browse-topics"><p class="eyebrow">Explore the words</p><div>{% for topic in ['Friendship', 'Dreams', 'Family', 'Nature'] %}<a href="{{ path('song_search', {q: topic}) }}">{{ topic }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="archive-context"><h2>About the songs</h2><p>Kid Pan Alley brings children and professional songwriters together to create songs collaboratively. This archive preserves and opens up the words and stories that emerge from that work.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.kidpanalley.org/">Visit Kid Pan Alley →</a></section>
{% endblock %}
